('irk','The Prophet''s migration to Madinah began in the year','["570 CE","632 CE","622 CE","610 CE"]'::jsonb,2,'The Islamic calendar starts from this year.'),
('irk','The year in which the Prophet (SAW) was born is known as the Year of the','["Camel","Elephant","Lion","Horse"]'::jsonb,1,'Abraha''s army with an elephant came to destroy the Ka''bah that year.'),
('irk','The father of the Prophet (SAW) was','["Abu Talib","Abdul Muttalib","Abdullah","Abu Lahab"]'::jsonb,2,'He died before the Prophet was born.'),
