('irk','The Prophet (SAW) received the first revelation at the age of','["twenty-five","thirty","fifty","forty"]'::jsonb,3,'It came in the month of Ramadan.'),
('irk','The longest chapter of the Qur''an is','["Al-Fatihah","Al-Imran","An-Nisa","Al-Baqarah"]'::jsonb,3,'It has 286 verses.'),
('irk','The Qur''an was revealed to the Prophet (SAW) gradually over about','["23 years","10 years","40 years","3 years"]'::jsonb,0,'Revelation began in Makkah and ended in Madinah.'),
